OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers face rail disruption
OL,4,Afor track replacements
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail passengers are expected to face
OL,7,Fweekend disruption due to maintenance
OL,8,Fwork between Norwich and Ipswich.
OL,10,FThe work will be carried out on
OL,11,Fweekends in September and October and
OL,12,Fwill affect routes through Norfolk and
OL,13,FSuffolk, including the East Suffolk
OL,14,Fline and Felixstowe branch line.
OL,16,FNetwork Rail said the work can only be
OL,17,Fcarried out when trains are not running
OL,18,Fand rail replacement buses for Greater
OL,19,FAnglia services will operate instead.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
